Z||000000||sjp777||05-27-2001||09:03 PM||||Even though I despise George W, with the passage of his tax plan we all get rebates this year.<BR>$300 for singles, $500 for single parents, and $600 for married couples.<P>We should all have our checks by September. I will be buying a kevlar clutch from Fierostore if my current one lasts until I get the check. If I have to replace it on my own before that, I will be calling Mr Mike for some leather seats when the check arrives.<P>What FIERO RELATED things will you all be doing with the extra cash?<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_2.jpg">    <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||14
